@startuml KTOB_15_state_memory
title KTOB — AI Memory Proposal Lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING : AI suggests insight
PENDING --> APPROVED : reader accepts/edits
PENDING --> DISMISSED : reader dismisses
APPROVED --> REVOKED : reader removes memory
DISMISSED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
note right of APPROVED
Only this state may provide a persistent
approved-memory signal for AI personalization.
Reader can edit the content or revoke approval.
end note
note right of DISMISSED
Dismissal is not a negative preference
and must not change the reader's boundaries.
end note
@enduml
